    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grim Diary is a rogue-like deck builder with anime art style.Currently on Early-Access</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/f3cfd707a835e3c1e4b08b697725c136.avif?t=1755477453\" width=275 height=373 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a8d1e50bbb59f55ae17aab404cb824c4.webp?t=1755477453\" width=314 height=15 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Premise:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate world following the protagonist Emi trying to bring back her sister\u2019s body back to normal after she\u2019s turned to a marionette to survive her sickness.Thus the start of their journey began.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a8d1e50bbb59f55ae17aab404cb824c4.webp?t=1755477453\" width=314 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Game Tutorial</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a3e59c05905a442c7fe6076e8d94d696.poster.avif?t=1755477453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a3e59c05905a442c7fe6076e8d94d696.webm?t=1755477453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a3e59c05905a442c7fe6076e8d94d696.mp4?t=1755477453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will explain the basic mechanics of the game. This can be skip\u00a0 if players wanted to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specifically made a tutorial to introduce even the players that don\u2019t any card or roguelike~like experience that want to try the genre. To hopefully encourage a variety of people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/8ad4002c9286990ed47d0e24dd902f1c.avif?t=1755477453\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined with Visual Novel Elements and while experiencing the team based roguelike of Grim diary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/ab08257781bf2f5d246b0ffdb29105ff.avif?t=1755477453\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/cde902065114ff92b4de5e621993541c.avif?t=1755477453\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre Survival</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's survival but has a unique gimmick on each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a8d1e50bbb59f55ae17aab404cb824c4.webp?t=1755477453\" width=314 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/f1011e4dea21de25f1733f83db2041f5.avif?t=1755477453\" width=456 height=522 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/6f23bbc185899995fea6fcea8fca07a1.avif?t=1755477453\" width=456 height=522 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >39+ Cards implemented In Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/c32c18b87066b7355377ff4db6ee0c5f.avif?t=1755477453\" width=82 height=83 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/4cb7d791f69e4ecac2cbcf1eba90d335.avif?t=1755477453\" width=73 height=109 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/be28ff1e8b3cb1c4c6972723ebf5392a.avif?t=1755477453\" width=120 height=121 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17+ Different Items can be acquired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a8d1e50bbb59f55ae17aab404cb824c4.webp?t=1755477453\" width=314 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Characters:</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/62c0aac61ccc6f17a632ba6c3142cf62.avif?t=1755477453\" width=219 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emi Blundle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elder sister serious and laid back personality.she\u2019s determine to find a way to bring her sister body back to normal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/e085a2a448d3c81e856c5812aa505757.avif?t=1755477453\" width=160 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli Blundle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living marionette use to live as a human until a illness struck her causing her body to deteriorate. Someone saved her, but her body became a doll living creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/b86246e42f2cc37b0b2df97495d0a8ac.avif?t=1755477453\" width=230 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yujin</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Emi\u2019s teacher is the one who helped her get accustomed to her new world before Emi found her sister. A librarian and mother figure to emi.Known in green wood guild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723410/extras/a8d1e50bbb59f55ae17aab404cb824c4.webp?t=1755477453\" width=314 height=15 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artists:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noshiyu,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meiboohu,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Izumi481,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mitch Logos </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LevVimi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
